      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Vision",
      "items": [
        "21 landmarks per hand, two hands maximum",
        "Left hand picks the chord, right hand shapes it",
        "Model and WASM vendored same-origin at build time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Audio",
      "items": [
        "PolySynth into filter, a six-slot FX rack, then volume",
        "The loop drives the engine imperatively, never via React",
        "Tone is dynamically imported, out of the entry chunk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Boundaries",
      "items": [
        "No server and no router: one React root, static dist/",
        "audio/ and vision/ never import each other",
        "onSelectSection is the loop's only call up into React"
      ]
    }
